<!--
  Reminders and celebrations and the reminder notifications (0.2, behind release.reminders).
  Verbatim from design v3 (reminders.png, reminder-notification.png) where it has the copy, then
  the handoff, new lines per docs/plans/screens/reminders.md.
  Same rules as strings.xml: no backslash escapes, positional format specifiers.

  The notification strings take no format arguments on purpose: a notification is a
  visibility surface, and a fixed string cannot carry a number the policy hides.
-->
